WEBVTT

00:04.330 --> 00:05.630
Good morning.

00:05.710 --> 00:08.420
Memorial services throughout
the country are planned for today,

00:08.500 --> 00:10.250
which marks six years since the Great Earthquake...

00:10.340 --> 00:14.680
Yikes. The conrod is cracked.

00:14.760 --> 00:16.550
This is hopeless.

00:20.060 --> 00:22.310
You didn't send it to the shop?

00:22.390 --> 00:24.230
Oh, good morning!

00:24.310 --> 00:28.360
We don't have the funds left to fix the engine.

00:28.440 --> 00:32.690
I put this one together myself,
so I thought I'd fix it on my own.

00:32.780 --> 00:35.700
And now for political and economic topics.

00:35.780 --> 00:37.700
The inaugural ceremony for Col. Romanov Cullenberg,

00:37.780 --> 00:40.240
chief director of the GGP Security Enforcement Unit...

00:40.330 --> 00:43.160
Rin! Clear the table, would you?

00:43.250 --> 00:48.170
Oh, sorry! I have club activities today,
so I thought it'd help remind me.

00:48.250 --> 00:49.840
On Sunday?

00:50.840 --> 00:54.300
I feel like I figured
something out during that last race.

00:54.380 --> 00:59.430
Like how to really ride RideBacks,
or how to draw out their true power...

00:59.510 --> 01:02.560
Say, Rin. Do you remember what today is?

01:02.640 --> 01:03.680
Huh?

01:04.850 --> 01:07.600
There's an outlet sale at the train station building.

01:07.690 --> 01:11.770
Sorry! I forgot! I promised to go with you, too...!

01:11.860 --> 01:16.450
Don't sweat it, partner.
I'll just take a quick look today.

01:16.530 --> 01:20.780
I'm just happy you've found
something to be engrossed in.

01:23.370 --> 01:25.830
Oh! This is super-good!

01:25.910 --> 01:27.080
Thanks!

01:27.170 --> 01:30.210
Oh, isn't that a RideBack?

01:30.290 --> 01:31.290
It is...

01:31.380 --> 01:33.630
--unveiling "White Rides," special vehicles

01:33.710 --> 01:36.010
to be introduced into the police force.

03:06.350 --> 03:10.850
Nothing's been happening.
We do have an intriguing new girl, though.

03:10.940 --> 03:13.650
She almost seems to be feigning indifference.

03:13.730 --> 03:16.360
Can't you ask her about her past?

03:16.440 --> 03:17.440
I can't.

03:17.530 --> 03:20.900
She glared at me when
I asked if she'd ever been overseas.

03:21.700 --> 03:24.870
All right. I'll contact you later.

03:26.830 --> 03:30.910
What?! We came here on our day off, too!

03:31.500 --> 03:36.290
I'm sorry! Today's activities
are canceled. I'm really sorry.

03:36.380 --> 03:39.630
That's mean! You could've at least texted us!

03:39.720 --> 03:44.680
We suddenly have to send the Balon
and Fuego into the shop in town...

03:44.760 --> 03:47.600
Oh, the Fuego was broken?

03:47.680 --> 03:52.480
Oh, no, I think he wanted it
tuned up while we were at it.

03:52.560 --> 03:54.440
Want us to keep it here?

03:56.110 --> 04:00.570
No. Could I get a ride into town, though?

04:00.650 --> 04:02.650
Sure. Are you running errands?

04:02.740 --> 04:05.070
Shoko's in town, doing shopping.

04:05.160 --> 04:07.370
Then I'll come too!

04:14.080 --> 04:17.000
Oh, you can come? Are you sure it's okay?

04:18.710 --> 04:20.130
Oh, I see.

04:20.210 --> 04:22.550
Okay, call again when you're nearby.

04:22.630 --> 04:23.670
Yeah.

04:27.930 --> 04:32.890
And these White Rides are better
than police motorcycles? I dunno...

04:32.980 --> 04:34.690
Not so loud.

04:34.770 --> 04:37.270
They're gonna show the real deal, I hope.

04:37.360 --> 04:40.070
A paper-mache imitation
won't make for a very good visual.

04:40.150 --> 04:42.650
Ms. Yoda, you're talking too loud!

04:42.740 --> 04:44.700
Thank you for your patience.

04:44.780 --> 04:47.030
We will now begin this joint press conference

04:47.120 --> 04:50.120
held by the vice president of Hesner Corporation.

04:51.500 --> 04:52.910
Security checkpoints?

04:53.000 --> 04:57.790
I forget, is today the GGP
commander's inauguration ceremony?

04:58.750 --> 05:01.050
I'm in front of the GGP headquarters.

05:01.130 --> 05:03.630
Any moment now,
newly-appointed Commander Romanov

05:03.720 --> 05:05.880
will be leaving for his inauguration ceremony.

05:05.970 --> 05:09.350
His route to the venue has been heavily secured...

05:09.430 --> 05:10.430
A traffic jam?

05:10.510 --> 05:13.770
Sorry. It might take a half-hour.

05:13.850 --> 05:18.520
Okay. I'm at the TV Tower
right now. I'll wait in the lobby cafe.

05:18.610 --> 05:20.480
Maybe I'll have a donut, too...

05:20.570 --> 05:24.490
Huh? Wait for me first! Suzuri's with me, too...

05:24.570 --> 05:27.530
Fine, I'll stick with some tea for now.

05:29.320 --> 05:30.830
What's that?

06:12.120 --> 06:15.410
Hello? Shoko? What happened?!

06:15.500 --> 06:17.870
I can't see anything...

06:27.130 --> 06:28.510
What is that?

06:32.930 --> 06:35.010
Shoko?! Hello?!

06:35.100 --> 06:37.060
Hey, what is that?!

06:38.350 --> 06:40.140
The city...

06:42.650 --> 06:45.020
Isn't that where Shoko is?!

06:49.030 --> 06:52.160
Everyone please remain calm!
Follow the staff's instructions!

06:52.240 --> 06:54.660
--Did you get that?
--Of course.

06:54.740 --> 06:57.830
This wasn't staged, right?

06:57.910 --> 06:59.460
Of course it wasn't.

07:00.120 --> 07:01.170
What's the situation?

07:01.250 --> 07:03.170
First perimeter is in place.

07:03.250 --> 07:05.920
Explosions in the building
and smoke grenades in the surroundings.

07:06.000 --> 07:08.340
No clear info from the disaster division yet.

07:09.260 --> 07:11.470
Responsibility was just claimed online.

07:11.550 --> 07:16.350
Understood. I'm going to
console the angry ol' commander now.

07:16.430 --> 07:18.100
What do we do, Hishida?

07:18.180 --> 07:21.350
There's nothing we can do in this traffic jam...

07:25.110 --> 07:26.320
Shoko...

07:34.490 --> 07:36.370
At 2:02 pm, there was an explosion

07:36.450 --> 07:39.540
on the 37th floor observation deck
of the TV Tower. Many injuries--

07:40.080 --> 07:44.880
The number of hostages is unclear,
but the heavily-armed terrorists inside--

07:44.960 --> 07:46.960
I'm in the outskirts of the city.

07:47.050 --> 07:51.550
At present, the city is shrouded in
yellow smoke rising from ten locations--

07:51.630 --> 07:56.300
It was confirmed that the anti-GGP
terrorist group known as the BMA

07:56.390 --> 08:00.470
has claimed responsibility
on its web site. This organization--

08:00.560 --> 08:02.560
We condemn the new appointment

08:02.640 --> 08:06.690
of the vile mass murderer
known as Colonel Romanov Cullenberg.

08:06.770 --> 08:12.030
In exchange for the hostages, we
demand a public debate with the colonel.

08:12.110 --> 08:15.320
The appointment of
an unfit leader must not be allowed.

08:15.410 --> 08:17.430
Closed to All Traffic

08:16.700 --> 08:21.580
The Cabinet has asked the police,
Security Enforcement, and GGP military

08:21.660 --> 08:24.830
to take anti-terrorism
measures to maintain public safety.

08:24.620 --> 08:24.850
Connecting Shoko

08:24.920 --> 08:29.380
At present, only emergency
vehicles are allowed into the city.

08:27.230 --> 08:28.820
Please wait

08:28.840 --> 08:29.820
Unable to connect

08:30.440 --> 08:30.690
Connecting Shoko

08:34.840 --> 08:36.970
<i>It's no good! I can't get through...!</i>

08:36.740 --> 08:39.370
Unable to connect

08:37.050 --> 08:41.020
Many people injured by
falling debris are being carried away.

08:41.100 --> 08:45.350
Details are unclear, but it appears
the center of the tower was severely...

08:45.440 --> 08:46.330
Shoko...

08:47.270 --> 08:48.560
Rin?

08:55.280 --> 08:57.320
I'm taking the Fuego there!

08:57.410 --> 09:00.120
Wait! I know how you feel, but the roads are closed--

09:00.200 --> 09:05.710
Calm down! There are tons of
terrorists everywhere! It's way dangerous!

09:12.050 --> 09:13.840
You can't, Ogata!

09:13.920 --> 09:15.470
Rin! Stop!

09:16.050 --> 09:18.220
I'll be back as soon as I save Shoko.

09:19.640 --> 09:21.220
Rin! Here!

09:26.690 --> 09:28.190
There she goes...

09:55.420 --> 09:57.880
<i>Please tell me you're all right...</i>

10:01.640 --> 10:06.730
We are not murderers. If you
do as we say, you will not be harmed.

10:22.870 --> 10:24.830
I have to contact the police...!

10:26.160 --> 10:27.500
No...!

10:32.000 --> 10:32.360
Connecting Rin

10:33.980 --> 10:35.150
Please wait

10:35.420 --> 10:40.340
All areas within a two-kilometer
radius of the tower have been sealed off.

10:40.430 --> 10:43.220
The Security Enforcement squad and the GGP military

10:43.310 --> 10:45.890
are forming a net around the terrorists.

10:45.970 --> 10:50.520
All citizens are asked to
evacuate the sealed areas immediately.

10:50.600 --> 10:53.650
Again, the areas considered dangerous

10:53.730 --> 11:00.360
are west districts 24, 25, 26, 37 and 51...

11:03.950 --> 11:07.160
Foolish terrorists, wouldn't you agree?

11:07.250 --> 11:10.410
I'm sorry that your inauguration ceremony was ruined.

11:10.500 --> 11:14.080
Why should I do anything for the hostages?

11:14.170 --> 11:18.590
The terrorists' actions will only
help with the White Rides' introduction

11:18.670 --> 11:21.300
and make my job easier...

11:28.980 --> 11:31.230
Almost seems like a small war.

11:31.940 --> 11:34.060
Ms. Yoda! We need to evacuate!

11:34.150 --> 11:36.230
Where's your journalist spirit?!

11:36.320 --> 11:38.610
I just don't feel like dying!

11:52.920 --> 11:53.270
Calling Rin

11:55.920 --> 11:58.550
Please, connect...!

12:03.720 --> 12:06.760
Shoko?! Hello?! Shoko?!

12:14.940 --> 12:17.820
Sorry, Rin, hold on...

12:40.000 --> 12:41.920
Hello?! Rin?!

12:42.010 --> 12:43.720
Shoko! Are you okay?!

12:43.800 --> 12:48.600
Where are you?! I just arrived
at the station. I'll be right there!

12:49.470 --> 12:51.430
The back of the second floor lobby...

12:53.940 --> 12:59.400
Don't come here, Rin.
There are-- guys with guns-- I'm--

12:59.480 --> 13:01.440
Shoko?! Hello?!

13:05.200 --> 13:06.700
Stop!

13:06.780 --> 13:08.030
What are you doing?!

13:08.120 --> 13:10.030
A RideBack...?

13:10.120 --> 13:13.330
Civilians are not allowed! You will leave immediately!

13:13.410 --> 13:16.000
My friend's inside the building.
I was just on the phone--

13:16.080 --> 13:21.040
It'll be all right. We'll rescue her.
But you have to leave now!

13:22.380 --> 13:23.840
Shoko!

13:33.390 --> 13:34.640
What...?!

13:34.730 --> 13:35.810
Stop, you!

13:37.980 --> 13:39.860
E-15 to HQ.

13:39.940 --> 13:43.900
A RideBack has ignored orders to
leave and is entering the building!

13:56.040 --> 13:57.500
My eyes...

14:00.130 --> 14:01.290
Rin...

14:15.180 --> 14:17.560
--Shoko!
--Rin!

14:18.810 --> 14:20.650
Shoko!

14:20.730 --> 14:21.650
Rin!

14:21.730 --> 14:22.770
Shoko!

14:22.860 --> 14:23.900
Rin!

14:25.490 --> 14:27.650
Are you okay, Shoko?!

14:27.740 --> 14:32.490
Rin...! You came for me! I was so scared!

14:33.120 --> 14:35.990
Sorry I took so long. Now let's get out of here!

14:36.080 --> 14:37.120
Yeah!

14:41.170 --> 14:42.880
Get behind me, Shoko.

14:47.220 --> 14:48.590
Freeze!

14:54.430 --> 14:56.640
A market model RideBack?

14:56.720 --> 15:01.100
Cut the engine and get off!
Where the hell were you hiding--?!

15:13.740 --> 15:16.240
Hold on, Shoko!

15:27.670 --> 15:29.880
What are you doing?! Fire!

15:35.220 --> 15:40.060
This is Area E-24! A possible
terrorist vehicle is heading for the bridge!

15:40.140 --> 15:42.060
It's a red RideBack!

15:44.650 --> 15:46.110
Whew!

15:46.770 --> 15:48.820
Looks like it's already started!

15:48.900 --> 15:51.860
Don't you think it's
dangerous to ignore evacuation orders?

15:51.950 --> 15:54.490
Big scoops don't just fall into your lap.

15:54.570 --> 15:57.120
What? Don't tell me we're going to the roof?!

15:57.200 --> 15:58.540
Hurry it up!

15:58.620 --> 15:59.870
You can't be serious...

15:59.950 --> 16:04.540
It appears that a special
GGP unit has just infiltrated the building.

16:04.630 --> 16:06.210
Let's go to Ms. Sasaki.

16:06.290 --> 16:11.470
I'm at the Minami Ohashi Bridge
about two kilometers from downtown.

16:11.550 --> 16:17.180
The GGP has sealed off all roads
leading into the city, cutting off all access.

16:17.260 --> 16:19.310
Due to the smoke surrounding the TV Tower,

16:19.390 --> 16:21.140
we are unable to tell what is happening.

16:21.230 --> 16:22.600
Please, God!

16:32.320 --> 16:36.780
What do we do? They think we're terrorists!

16:42.620 --> 16:44.080
<i>It's strange.</i>

16:44.170 --> 16:50.210
<i>The Fuego feels so close to me,</i>
<i>just like during that first time I rode it...</i>

16:50.300 --> 16:53.380
<i>It almost feels like my own arms and legs...</i>

17:23.370 --> 17:24.960
Ms. Yoda! Down there!

17:51.480 --> 17:53.440
Rin! Behind us...!

17:59.200 --> 18:01.120
Something is happening on the Minami Ohashi Bridge!

18:01.200 --> 18:04.490
A RideBack-like vehicle
has come from the downtown area

18:04.580 --> 18:06.250
with a helicopter in pursuit!

18:06.330 --> 18:12.540
It's unclear from this vantage point,
but it could be a fleeing terrorist!

18:23.810 --> 18:25.930
Let's get off, Rin...

18:26.020 --> 18:29.440
I'm sure they'll understand if we explain it to them!

18:29.520 --> 18:31.310
Hey, Rin...!

18:41.200 --> 18:43.160
You're not going to jump?

18:46.330 --> 18:47.290
What?!

18:52.960 --> 18:55.590
Shoko, don't let go, whatever happens!

19:24.830 --> 19:27.540
<i>There it is again... This light...</i>

19:43.340 --> 19:47.720
Th-The helicopter... it just exploded!

19:47.810 --> 19:50.270
The RideBack leapt through its flames...

19:50.350 --> 19:52.100
Rin...?

19:52.190 --> 19:55.150
What is she doing?

20:04.120 --> 20:07.330
Shoko. We're safe now.

20:07.410 --> 20:09.200
Shoko?

20:19.380 --> 20:22.420
A Type L Fuego, huh?

20:22.510 --> 20:24.130
Were you chosen?

20:24.220 --> 20:25.800
Huh?

20:25.890 --> 20:31.640
It's been given special tuning
that lets it choose its rider.

20:31.730 --> 20:33.270
U-Umm...

20:33.350 --> 20:34.390
Go.

20:43.200 --> 20:47.490
The major terrorist incident that
began in the TV Tower at 2:02 pm today

20:47.580 --> 20:52.000
ended at 4:30, when the GGP's S.E.U.
and military infiltrated the building

20:52.080 --> 20:55.040
and killed the five terrorists
who masterminded the attack.

20:55.120 --> 20:57.920
The government has offered its gratitude to the GGP

20:58.000 --> 21:01.460
for neutralizing the situation
with minimal casualties.

21:01.550 --> 21:05.510
After this latest heavily-armed
terrorist attack by the BMA,

21:05.590 --> 21:08.510
the newly-appointed
Colonel Romanov offered his condolences

21:08.600 --> 21:11.510
to those affected and declared
that he will remain steadfast

21:11.600 --> 21:15.390
and put an end to the terrorist attacks at all costs.

21:35.750 --> 21:40.130
Rin... Don't go... Rin...

21:49.800 --> 21:51.430
<i>That light...</i>

21:56.730 --> 22:01.400
Even when he laughs

22:03.400 --> 22:08.990
I'm thinking of you before I realize it

22:12.030 --> 22:17.040
And the hands holding his

22:18.830 --> 22:24.300
feel your warmth, too

22:26.470 --> 22:30.220
Even if I cut out my recollections

22:30.300 --> 22:34.180
and drive them out of my heart

22:34.270 --> 22:37.930
or try to kick the memories out

22:38.020 --> 22:42.400
I still think of you

22:42.480 --> 22:46.900
Time now passes and seasons fly by

22:46.990 --> 22:50.740
Even if that smile starts to become hazy

22:50.820 --> 22:54.740
my heart will never forget you

22:54.830 --> 22:58.500
(even if we can never meet again)

22:58.580 --> 23:02.330
Even if I knock over photos of us smiling

23:02.420 --> 23:06.760
or try to hide my overflowing feelings

23:07.720 --> 23:10.970
my heart will never forget

23:11.680 --> 23:14.930
my memories with you

23:26.030 --> 23:41.020
New Hishida Theatre

23:27.400 --> 23:29.950
--This is bad! This is bad!
--Calm down, Hishida!

23:30.030 --> 23:34.160
But, terrorists! Explosions!
And she broke right through the GGP's net!

23:34.240 --> 23:37.410
Don't worry about it.
You're a side character. You can't do anything.

23:35.870 --> 23:39.600
Next Episode:

23:35.870 --> 23:39.600
The Mysterious RideBack Girl

23:37.500 --> 23:39.620
What?!
